    "title": "Fake GPS Location- LocaEdit",
    "description": "LocaEdit is a useful app for Fake GPS location. To play location change pranks, just tap to change your phone's GPS location.\r\n\r\nWill override your current location and any app you want to test will assume you are in New York, London, or anywhere else in the world!\r\n\r\nKey Feature::\r\n\r\nTeleport Mode\r\nChange GPS location with one click and easily teleport your phone anywhere in the world . This app sets a Fake GPS location so that all other app in your phone believe you are there!\r\n\r\nJoystick Mode\r\n360\u00b0 joystick movement, one key to switch the speed of walking, riding, driving, you can also customize the speed unit and value, smooth control, enhance the game experience.\r\n\r\nSimulated Navigation Mode\r\nSimulated navigation routes with the option to plan trips on foot, by bike or by car\r\n\r\nSimulate Multi-Point Route Mode\r\nSimulate multi-point routes, with the option of travelling on foot, by bicycle or by car\r\n\r\nGame Mode\r\nFor AR games, it can help people who are unable to play location-based AR games properly due to physical conditions, social regulations or climate.\r\n\r\nPrivacy Protection\r\nEffectively protect your real location information, safeguard your personal privacy and security Support popular apps\r\n\r\nSuitable for most apps\r\nSupports most location-based social media apps, AR games, navigation apps and location service apps to fully meet your application needs.\r\n With this location faker and GPS changer, you can spoof your phone's GPS position. GPS spoofing and location simulation has never been easier!",
